<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41208" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-σχεσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπέχω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>checking, stoppage,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἐπισχέσιος</span> after an
				<i>abatement</i> of fever, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.7
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισχέσεις γενέσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					740d
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					962a1
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπνοῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					7.175
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς φωνῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Demetr.</u>
					38
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἀδικούντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.20.23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>delay, reluctance,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεὶ οὔ τις ἐπίσχεσις οὐδ᾽ ἐλεητύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.451
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἐν τῇ Οἰνόῃ ἐ.</span>
			<i>delay</i> or <i>lingering</i> there, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.18
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				283.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
